==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*zъlъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*źulas}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*ǵʰwel-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-злой.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|злой|зле́е|зле́йший}}

# [[wicked]], [[evil]], [[ill-natured]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''злы́е''' [[дело|дела́]]|'''evil''' deeds}}
# [[malicious]], [[malevolent]], [[spiteful]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Его́]] [[губа|гу́бы]] [[искривить|искриви́ла]] '''зла́я''' [[улы́бка]].|A '''malevolent''' smile played on his lips.}}
# [[angry]], [[enraged]], "[[mad]]"
#: {{uxi|ru|Он был '''зол''' на всех.|He was '''mad''' at everyone.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[осторожно|Осторо́жно]], '''зла́я''' [[соба́ка]]!|Beware of '''angry''' dog.}}
# [[rabid]], [[irate]], [[venomous]]
# [[fierce]], [[severe]], [[bitter]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''злой''' [[ве́тер]]|a '''bitter''' wind}}
# [[ill]], [[harmful]], [[evil]], [[bad]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''зла́я''' [[судьба́]]|an '''ill''' fate}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} [[pungent]], [[stinging]], painfully [[spicy]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''зла́я''' [[припра́ва]]|a '''pungent''' seasoning}}
# {{lb|ru|medicine}} [[malignant]]

